ks to everybody who helped  contribute to suba  thanks to our studio for putting this  together and thanks to the army of  people who gave feedback on this talk  and made it much much better than its  first version  so thanks for watching i hope you'll try  suba out  and if you have any questions please  feel free to reach out to me  on github or on twitter at chow the dog  thanks  [Music]  you

